Subject: [PATCH 1/3] E2 of the odd-core study: e1_smooth --export writes every
 distinct smooth conflict it finds as a store of nogoods; e2_validate checks a
 store at a game's root as a search does and writes the nogoods kept; a search
 with a store says at its end how many candidates its nogoods ruled out and
 how many nodes they ended; --carried-dir reads up to READ_CAP = 200,000 sets
 (DIR_CAP, 20,000, still caps a harvest)

